{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":32,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Indeed a King will reign according to righteousness, And the rulers will rule according to justice.","tok":[{"t":"Indeed a "},{"t":"King","s":["H4428"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"reign","s":["H4427"],"a":[2]},{"t":" according to "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And the rulers will "},{"t":"rule","s":["H8323"],"a":[6]},{"t":" according to justice."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And a man will be like a refuge from the wind And a covering from the tempest, Like streams of water in a dry place, Like the shadow of a massive rock in a wasted land.","tok":[{"t":"And a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will be like a refuge from the "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[3]},{"t":" And a "},{"t":"covering","s":["H5643"],"a":[4]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"tempest","s":["H2230"],"a":[5]},{"t":", Like streams of "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in a dry "},{"t":"place","s":["H6724"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Like the "},{"t":"shadow","s":["H6738"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"massive","s":["H3515"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rock","s":["H5553"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in a "},{"t":"wasted","s":["H5889"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And the eyes of those who see will not be dim, And the ears of those who hear will attend.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of those who "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will not be "},{"t":"dim","s":["H8159"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"ears","s":["H0241"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of those who "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will attend."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And the heart of the hasty will understand knowledge, And the tongue of those who stammer will hasten to speak elegantly.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the hasty will "},{"t":"understand","s":["H0995"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"tongue","s":["H3956"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of those who stammer will hasten to "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"elegantly","s":["H6703"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"The fool will no longer be called noble, Nor will the cheat be said to be generous;","tok":[{"t":"The fool will no longer be "},{"t":"called","s":["H7121"],"a":[1]},{"t":" noble, Nor will the cheat be "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to be "},{"t":"generous","s":["H7771"],"a":[8]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":6,"text":"For the fool will speak foolishness, And his heart will commit iniquity By committing profaneness And by speaking error against Jehovah, By leaving the soul of the hungry empty And by causing drink for the thirsty to fail.","tok":[{"t":"For the fool will "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[3]},{"t":" foolishness, And his "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will commit "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[6]},{"t":" By committing profaneness And by speaking "},{"t":"error","s":["H8442"],"a":[12]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":", By "},{"t":"leaving","s":["H7324"],"a":[13]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"hungry","s":["H7457"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"empty","s":["H7324"],"a":[13]},{"t":" And by causing "},{"t":"drink","s":["H4945"],"a":[16]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"thirsty","s":["H6771"],"a":[17]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"fail","s":["H2637"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"And as for the cheat, his tools are evil; He devises wicked schemes To destroy the poor with false words Even when the needy speaks rightly.","tok":[{"t":"And as for the cheat, his tools are "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; He "},{"t":"devises","s":["H3289"],"a":[5]},{"t":" wicked schemes To "},{"t":"destroy","s":["H2254"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"poor","s":["H6041"],"a":[7]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"false","s":["H8267"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"words","s":["H0561"],"a":[8]},{"t":" Even when the "},{"t":"needy","s":["H0034"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"speaks","s":["H1696"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rightly","s":["H4941"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"But the noble man devises noble things, And upon noble things he stands.","tok":[{"t":"But the noble man "},{"t":"devises","s":["H3289"],"a":[2]},{"t":" noble "},{"t":"things","s":["H5081"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And upon noble "},{"t":"things","s":["H5081"],"a":[5]},{"t":" he "},{"t":"stands","s":["H6965"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Rise up, O women who are at ease, And hear my voice; O daughters of complacency, Hearken to my words.","tok":[{"t":"Rise "},{"t":"up","s":["H6965"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"women","s":["H0802"],"a":[0]},{"t":" who are at "},{"t":"ease","s":["H7600"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[3]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"O","s":["H0982"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"daughters","s":["H1323"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of complacency, Hearken to my words."}]},{"n":10,"text":"In a year and some days You will be troubled, O complacent ones; For the vintage is at its end; The ingathering will not come.","tok":[{"t":"In a "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and some "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" You will be "},{"t":"troubled","s":["H7264"],"a":[3]},{"t":", O complacent ones; For the "},{"t":"vintage","s":["H1210"],"a":[7]},{"t":" is at its end; The ingathering will not "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Tremble, O women at ease; Be troubled, O complacent ones. Strip yourselves and be bare, And gird your loins with sackcloth.","tok":[{"t":"Tremble","s":["H2729"],"a":[0]},{"t":", O women at "},{"t":"ease","s":["H7600"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; Be "},{"t":"troubled","s":["H7264"],"a":[2]},{"t":", O complacent "},{"t":"ones","s":["H0982"],"a":[3]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Strip","s":["H6584"],"a":[4]},{"t":" yourselves and be "},{"t":"bare","s":["H6209"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"gird","s":["H2290"]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"loins","s":["H2504"],"a":[8]},{"t":" with sackcloth."}]},{"n":12,"text":"They beat their breasts For the pleasant fields, For the fruitful vine.","tok":[{"t":"They beat their breasts For the "},{"t":"pleasant","s":["H2531"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"fields","s":["H7704"],"a":[4]},{"t":", For the "},{"t":"fruitful","s":["H6509"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Upon the land of my people Will come up thorns and briers, Indeed upon all the jubilant houses In the exultant city.","tok":[{"t":"Upon the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0127"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Will come "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"thorns","s":["H6975"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"briers","s":["H8068"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Indeed upon all the jubilant "},{"t":"houses","s":["H1004"],"a":[9]},{"t":" In the exultant "},{"t":"city","s":["H7151"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Because the palace will be abandoned; The multitude of the city will be forsaken; The Hill and the watchtower Will become caves forever, A joy for wild asses, A pasture for flocks;","tok":[{"t":"Because the "},{"t":"palace","s":["H0759"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will be abandoned; The "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H1995"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"forsaken","s":["H5203"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; The Hill and the watchtower Will become caves forever, A "},{"t":"joy","s":["H4885"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"for","s":["H5704"],"a":[11]},{"t":" wild "},{"t":"asses","s":["H6501"],"a":[14]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"pasture","s":["H4829"],"a":[15]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"flocks","s":["H5739"],"a":[16]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":15,"text":"Until the Spirit is poured upon us from on high, And the wilderness becomes a fruitful field, And the fruitful field is considered to be a forest.","tok":[{"t":"Until the "},{"t":"Spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"poured","s":["H6168"],"a":[1]},{"t":" upon us from on "},{"t":"high","s":["H4791"],"a":[4]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"wilderness","s":["H4057"],"a":[6]},{"t":" becomes a fruitful "},{"t":"field","s":["H3759"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And the fruitful "},{"t":"field","s":["H3759"],"a":[8]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"considered","s":["H2803"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to be a "},{"t":"forest","s":["H3293"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Then justice will dwell in the wilderness, And righteousness will remain in the fruitful field;","tok":[{"t":"Then justice will "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H7931"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"wilderness","s":["H4057"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"remain","s":["H3427"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in the fruitful "},{"t":"field","s":["H3759"],"a":[4]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":17,"text":"And the work of righteousness will be peace, And the result of righteousness, quietness and assurance forever.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"result","s":["H5656"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[5]},{"t":", "},{"t":"quietness","s":["H8252"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"assurance","s":["H0983"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"forever","s":["H5769"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"And my people will live in a peaceful habitation And in secure dwellings and carefree resting places.","tok":[{"t":"And my "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will live in a peaceful "},{"t":"habitation","s":["H5116"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And in "},{"t":"secure","s":["H4009"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"dwellings","s":["H4908"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and carefree resting "},{"t":"places","s":["H4496"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"And it will hail when the forest comes down, And the city will be utterly laid low.","tok":[{"t":"And it will "},{"t":"hail","s":["H1258"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"when","s":["H3381"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"forest","s":["H3293"],"a":[2]},{"t":" comes "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will be utterly laid "},{"t":"low","s":["H8213"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":20,"text":"Blessed are you who sow beside all the water, Who send there the feet of the ox and the donkey.","tok":[{"t":"Blessed","s":["H0835"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are you who "},{"t":"sow","s":["H2232"],"a":[1]},{"t":" beside all the "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Who send there the "},{"t":"feet","s":["H7272"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"ox","s":["H7794"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"donkey","s":["H2543"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]}]}
